{"type":"standard","title":"Phunoi language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Phunoi language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q7188361","titles":{"canonical":"Phunoi_language","normalized":"Phunoi language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Phunoi language</span></span>"},"pageid":33336651,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1330659641","tid":"72035308-e747-11f0-a27a-8dacb8b6b61a","timestamp":"2026-01-01T19:24:09Z","description":"Sino-Tibetan language spoken in Laos","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phunoi_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phunoi_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phunoi_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Phunoi_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phunoi_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Phunoi_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phunoi_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Phunoi_language"}},"extract":"Phunoi (Sinsali) is a Loloish language of northern Laos. Dialects are divergent and may be distinct languages; these are Black Khoany, White Khoany, Mung, Hwethom, Khaskhong. Bradley cites six languages within Phunoi.","extract_html":"<p><b>Phunoi</b> (Sinsali) is a Loloish language of northern Laos. Dialects are divergent and may be distinct languages; these are Black Khoany, White Khoany, Mung, Hwethom, Khaskhong. Bradley cites six languages within Phunoi.</p>"}